1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:19,460
You still want more?

2
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:21,340
I can respect that.

3
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:22,220
Let's go.

4
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:24,500
Gathering Clouds sword style.

5
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:25,540
Now.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,260
Is that all?

7
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:38,420
Almost.

8
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:39,580
Too bad.

9
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,220
Time's up.

10
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:44,940
Mana Takamiya wins.

11
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:48,060
How did she win ten against one?

12
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:52,260
Then again, I probably shouldn't be too surprised.

13
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,800
That girl did kill a spirit.

14
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,720
Real sister.

15
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:04,440
Adopted sister.

16
00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:09,240
Does a single word make all the difference in determining the kind of love one receives?

17
00:01:10,060 --> 00:01:10,960
What is appropriate?

18
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:12,460
And what is forbidden?

19
00:01:13,740 --> 00:01:14,580
Who can say?

20
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:18,220
Why do?

21
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:26,960
Yeah.

22
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:56,880
Let's pray.

23
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:58,880
Oh

24
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:46,880
All right, please introduce yourself again. I'm Second Lieutenant Mana Takamiya. Pleased to fight alongside all of you. Well, we've got that out of the way now.

25
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:55,880
Seriously, what's the big idea destroying valuable equipment in a practice match?

26
00:02:55,880 --> 00:03:00,880
Oh, it won't happen again, Captain. I heard she's the best fighter the Ground Forces got.

27
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:08,880
Don't let it happen again, okay? We're about to go over the fight with the Hermit Spirit. So have a seat and join us.

28
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:09,880
Yes, of course, ma'am.

29
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:20,880
The Captain is kind of hard-headed, isn't she? Being stubborn strategically will play right into the Spirit's hands if she's not more careful.

30
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:21,880
I agree.

31
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:23,880
Glad I'm not the only one.

32
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:28,880
All everyone has been talking about is how you've killed a spirit before. Would you mind if I asked you how you did it?

33
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:37,880
Well, the word sure travels fast around here. Well, no two spirits are alike, so if you want to fight effectively, it's important to remember. You can't deal with them all the same way.

34
00:03:37,880 --> 00:03:38,880
Hmm.

35
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:46,880
Yeah, with how hectic things have been lately, I think you'll figure out what I mean soon enough. That's why I've been assigned here, after all.

36
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:50,880
Brother?

37
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:55,880
We got absolutely destroyed in today's match.

38
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:59,880
Well, that's the life of a backup, I guess. We might as well get used to it.

39
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:05,880
Care to explain yourself? Shido never mentioned he had another little sister.

40
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:08,880
Oh, I'm sorry. Are you a friend of his?

41
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:12,880
We're not friends. We're together.

42
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:17,880
Good morning, everyone. May I have your attention?

43
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:23,880
Are you ready for a surprise? A transfer student is joining our class today.

44
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,880
Huh? Didn't Toka transfer a while ago?

45
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:28,880
Okay, come on in.

46
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:44,880
Hello, guys. My name is Kurumi Tokisaki.

47
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:49,880
Oh, yeah!

48
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:53,880
Just so you know, I'm actually a spirit.

49
00:04:58,880 --> 00:05:00,880
Um, let's move on.

50
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:06,880
Well, that's one of the more unique introductions this class has had. Go ahead and take a seat anywhere.

51
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:08,880
Before I said, could someone do me a quick favor?

52
00:05:08,880 --> 00:05:10,880
Oh, do you need something?

53
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:16,880
Since I'm new. I'm afraid I don't know my way around the school that well. Would anyone be so kind as to show me around?

54
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:20,880
I'm really sorry to trouble you, but I promise I'll make it worth your while.

55
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:21,880
Yeah, you betcha I'll do it!

56
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:23,880
Not you, but thanks.

57
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:24,880
Oh.

58
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:29,880
Would you be interested in helping me? It's Shido, right?

59
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:31,880
Huh? Uh, yeah, okay.

60
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:37,880
So you're completely sure, without a doubt?

61
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:38,880
I am.

62
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:42,880
The spirit transferred to the high school. Well, give her credit for being creative.

63
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:44,880
She's not your typical spirit.

64
00:05:45,880 --> 00:05:48,880
To start with, she's deadlier than all the others.

65
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:55,880
Over 10,000 people have died by her hands. The number's even bigger when you take into account all the spatial quake deaths.

66
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:57,880
Are you kidding me?

67
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:05,880
It's been confirmed on our end, too. I didn't think she'd turn out to be an actual spirit, but this could definitely work in our favor.

68
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:10,880
So I want you to try and work your charm and make her fall in love with you before the AST attacks.

69
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:12,880
Hi, Shido.

70
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:15,880
Are you ready to show me a good time?

71
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:16,880
Uh, sure.

72
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:26,880
Which romantic getaway should we head to first?

73
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:27,880
Uh...

74
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:32,880
Make your choices quick, team. He's on the spot.

75
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:38,880
Huh. The roof looks awfully popular. But which of you went with number three?

76
00:06:39,880 --> 00:06:40,880
That was me.

77
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:42,880
And how did you arrive at that answer?

78
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:46,880
Through process of elimination. The school nurse is in her office.

79
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:52,880
And as for the roof, it's a much lovelier view to witness at sunset. Just my two cents.

80
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:54,880
Who knew you were such a romantic?

81
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:56,880
Hey, Shido. You get all that?

82
00:06:56,880 --> 00:07:00,880
Why don't we start with the cafeteria and student store?

83
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:01,880
Okay.

84
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:05,880
What does she think she's trying to pull?

85
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:08,880
No one else is going to get between Shido and me.

86
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:12,880
A lot of people like yakisoba. It's a cafeteria classic.

87
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:13,880
How interesting.

88
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:17,880
I'll give you my personal recommendation. It's this one. The durian bread.

89
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:19,880
But you'll have to brush your teeth after eating it.

90
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:21,880
How interesting.

91
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:23,880
Are you even listening?

92
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:26,880
Uh, are you okay?

93
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:32,880
Yeah, just zoned out for a second. It's hard to concentrate with such a handsome man in front of me.

94
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:33,880
Excuse me?

95
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:35,880
It won't do us any good if you fall for her.

96
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:37,880
Right. Sorry.

97
00:07:37,880 --> 00:07:40,880
She's different from the ones we've faced in the past.

98
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:44,880
Hopefully Shido can keep his act together and get more info on her for us.

99
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:46,880
Hm?

100
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:50,880
Right on cue. The next set of options.

101
00:07:50,880 --> 00:07:51,880
I say number three.

102
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:52,880
And why is that?

103
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:56,880
I'm interested in seeing her panties. And that's pretty much it.

104
00:07:57,880 --> 00:08:00,880
No, wait! Have mercy! Have mercy!

105
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:03,880
Like I'm the only one that thinks these things!

106
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:06,880
Kurumi, what kind of panties are you wearing?

107
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:10,880
How did that pervy choice sneak in there?

108
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:11,880
Hey, question.

109
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:15,880
Uh, Kurumi? What kind of panties are you wearing?

110
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:20,880
Panties? Like right now?

111
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:23,880
Numb skull! Those weren't your instructions, dummy!

112
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:26,880
You were supposed to ask her about being a spirit!

113
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:29,880
Whatever! Just change the subject or something, moron!

114
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:31,880
Ease up. It was an honest mistake.

115
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:33,880
Would you like to take a peek at them?

116
00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:35,880
Huh?

117
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:37,880
I don't mind. As long as it's you.

118
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:38,880
Huh?

119
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:39,880
Huh?

120
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:40,880
Huh?

121
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:41,880
Huh?

122
00:08:41,880 --> 00:08:42,880
Huh?

123
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:43,880
Huh?

124
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:44,880
Huh?

125
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:48,880
Ah!

126
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:49,880
Stop!

127
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:50,880
That's good enough! Thanks!

128
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:59,980
Stop!

129
00:09:01,060 --> 00:09:02,400
That's good enough, thanks.

130
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,720
You're so cute when you're shy.

131
00:09:06,220 --> 00:09:06,940
Moving on.

132
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,280
What did you mean earlier today?

133
00:09:09,660 --> 00:09:10,760
You said you were a spirit.

134
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:14,500
You don't have to play dumb with me, silly.

135
00:09:14,900 --> 00:09:19,360
Besides, I already know that you know all about the spirits inside and out.

136
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:23,820
But how do you know so much about me?

137
00:09:24,060 --> 00:09:25,540
That's my little secret.

138
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:28,880
There's only one thing I can tell you about myself.

139
00:09:29,620 --> 00:09:34,180
Ever since I first found out about you, I've been crazy in love and hoping you'd notice me.

140
00:09:34,460 --> 00:09:36,760
I'm so happy the two of us are finally alone.

141
00:09:37,180 --> 00:09:39,040
It's exactly how I dreamed it would be.

142
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:42,240
Hey, are you still listening?

143
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:47,680
Now that I've got your attention, I need you to do a favor for me.

144
00:09:48,140 --> 00:09:50,000
If you think you can handle it, of course.

145
00:09:50,880 --> 00:10:04,960
Toka? Origami?

146
00:10:05,420 --> 00:10:06,520
This is awkward.

147
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:09,880
What exactly are the two of you doing barging in on us?

148
00:10:10,660 --> 00:10:12,840
I was just looking for Shido, that's all!

149
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:15,560
Students are not supposed to hold hands at school.

150
00:10:15,860 --> 00:10:17,100
Let go of him right now.

151
00:10:17,100 --> 00:10:23,240
I'm sorry, but I can't. I have a crippling case of anemia.

152
00:10:23,980 --> 00:10:29,460
Shido was kind enough to offer his body so that if I faint, I'll simply land in his waiting arms.

153
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:32,980
My anemia.

154
00:10:32,980 --> 00:10:37,100
I can't believe how pathetic you two are.

155
00:10:37,900 --> 00:10:41,720
Uh-oh. I think my anemone's kicking in, too.

156
00:10:41,900 --> 00:10:42,360
Your what?

157
00:10:42,740 --> 00:10:46,660
It makes me sway back and forth until fish are attracted by my cuteness.

158
00:10:46,940 --> 00:10:49,240
She said her anemia, not sea anemone.

159
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:49,620
Whoa.

160
00:10:50,180 --> 00:10:51,760
Looks like they're fighting over him.

161
00:10:51,820 --> 00:10:54,860
This is intense. Is he already trying to hook up with a transfer student?

162
00:10:55,140 --> 00:10:56,520
It hasn't even been a day yet.

163
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:57,840
What? That's so lame!

164
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:03,520
Thank you so much for showing me around the school today.

165
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:06,920
I would have been lost without you, so thank you.

166
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:11,540
That being said, next time I want to do it with you alone.

167
00:11:14,020 --> 00:11:16,660
Alrighty then, I guess I'll see you two in class tomorrow.

168
00:11:16,660 --> 00:11:22,320
Maybe it was a good thing Toka and Origami were there.

169
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:24,200
Otherwise, who knows what would have happened.

170
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:27,140
Oh, hey. Where did Origami go?

171
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:30,760
Huh? Beats me. She probably already went home without us.

172
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,520
Shido, tasty Shido.

173
00:11:36,540 --> 00:11:38,780
Easy, girl. Don't get excited just yet.

174
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:40,700
You'll need a little more patience than that.

175
00:11:41,220 --> 00:11:43,520
I'll be sure to save the best for last.

176
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:47,680
Oh my gosh, I'm sorry. I guess I didn't see you there.

177
00:11:47,900 --> 00:11:50,200
Yeah. What was that for, bitch?

178
00:11:50,760 --> 00:11:54,100
You gotta do a lot more for me than just say sorry if you wanna go free.

179
00:11:54,420 --> 00:11:56,420
Damn, this one's looking hella fine.

180
00:11:56,780 --> 00:11:58,320
Give us your name before we get down.

181
00:11:58,560 --> 00:12:00,160
Don't worry, we don't bite that hard.

182
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:01,800
Fellas, hold on a sec.

183
00:12:02,020 --> 00:12:04,640
Oh, wow. Sorry about the bump.

184
00:12:05,020 --> 00:12:07,720
Maybe I can make it up to you with a different kind of bumping.

185
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:10,280
Ah, damn, you really are a slut. Awesome.

186
00:12:10,640 --> 00:12:12,740
We're gonna treat that pretty face real nice.

187
00:12:12,740 --> 00:12:15,080
We're taking turns, and I get to go first.

188
00:12:15,420 --> 00:12:17,580
Come now. There's plenty to go around.

189
00:12:18,020 --> 00:12:21,500
Follow me and see for yourself how I like to have fun, if you dare.

190
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:25,700
Why don't you guys hold her while I get this party started?

191
00:12:29,860 --> 00:12:30,840
What the hell?

192
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:31,800
Help!

193
00:12:31,800 --> 00:12:42,320
Thanks for the snack, boys.

194
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:47,060
Did I arrive too late?

195
00:12:47,900 --> 00:12:48,660
Well, hello.

196
00:12:49,060 --> 00:12:50,480
You just missed all the fun.

197
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:53,740
You really ought to learn how to clean up after you eat.

198
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:55,360
Right, Nightmare?

199
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:57,460
Burgers!

200
00:12:57,460 --> 00:13:03,500
Tonight I'm in the mood for some burgers.

201
00:13:03,700 --> 00:13:05,520
Ooh, that sounds good. Go with that!

202
00:13:06,880 --> 00:13:08,920
Hmm, I guess we'll have to see.

203
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:12,460
I don't believe it.

204
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:13,720
It's really you.

205
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:16,140
Origami was telling the truth after all.

206
00:13:16,280 --> 00:13:17,300
Do you know this girl?

207
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:18,640
No, I don't.

208
00:13:18,640 --> 00:13:19,200
Huh?

209
00:13:20,780 --> 00:13:21,220
Hi.

210
00:13:21,860 --> 00:13:22,120
Eh?

211
00:13:22,620 --> 00:13:23,400
Who's that?

212
00:13:23,500 --> 00:13:24,340
Big Brother!

213
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:26,360
Huh?

214
00:13:27,460 --> 00:13:29,560
This is such a nice place you got here.

215
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:31,220
I can't wait to see it.

216
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:33,120
It's nice to meet you.

217
00:13:33,380 --> 00:13:36,080
I never thought my brother would be living with so many women.

218
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:37,860
Everyone's so pretty, too.

219
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:39,280
Thanks for keeping an eye on him.

220
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:40,600
Well, this was unexpected.

221
00:13:40,900 --> 00:13:43,440
How many more sisters do you think Shido's hiding from us?

222
00:13:43,540 --> 00:13:44,180
Who knows?

223
00:13:44,260 --> 00:13:45,660
He's a true man of mystery.

224
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:46,980
Juicy, juicy!

225
00:13:46,980 --> 00:13:49,440
It's not like I actually knew she even existed.

226
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:50,300
Wait a minute.

227
00:13:50,420 --> 00:13:52,440
What are Yoshino and Yoshinan doing here, too?

228
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:53,640
Um, sorry.

229
00:13:54,100 --> 00:13:55,160
Please forgive us.

230
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:55,760
Oh, no.

231
00:13:55,940 --> 00:13:57,440
It's really not that big a deal to me.

232
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:00,180
Look at them!

233
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,380
They're so super alike, it's crazy!

234
00:14:02,980 --> 00:14:03,960
That's no surprise.

235
00:14:04,300 --> 00:14:05,860
We are related, after all.

236
00:14:06,100 --> 00:14:07,780
Yeah, it's funny you should mention that.

237
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:10,280
I've been his little sister for as long as I can remember.

238
00:14:11,220 --> 00:14:12,420
Wow, what a coincidence.

239
00:14:12,800 --> 00:14:14,080
Does that make you my big sister?

240
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:15,140
No, of course not!

241
00:14:15,140 --> 00:14:19,640
We were both still little kids when my family adopted Shido, so we're as close to siblings

242
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:20,420
as we can be.

243
00:14:20,520 --> 00:14:22,620
You mean, except for actually being siblings.

244
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:25,660
Hey, Mana, little sis, I've got a question for you.

245
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:25,860
Oh?

246
00:14:26,060 --> 00:14:27,620
Go ahead and ask away, then.

247
00:14:27,780 --> 00:14:28,000
Huh.

248
00:14:28,500 --> 00:14:31,000
Well, uh, it's just that...

249
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:33,540
Well, no offense, but, uh, I don't remember you.

250
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:35,040
That doesn't surprise me.

251
00:14:35,620 --> 00:14:36,180
It's weird.

252
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:39,360
The past is such a blank that sometimes I think my memory's been erased.

253
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:39,820
Huh?

254
00:14:40,180 --> 00:14:41,620
You've gotta be kidding me!

255
00:14:41,740 --> 00:14:43,860
What the heck do you mean your memory's been erased?

256
00:14:43,860 --> 00:14:48,520
I remember the past two or three years, okay, but anything before that is a complete blur.

257
00:14:48,740 --> 00:14:49,120
Crazy.

258
00:14:49,420 --> 00:14:50,860
So you don't remember Mom either?

259
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:51,700
No.

260
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:53,760
No, I'm afraid I don't.

261
00:14:53,980 --> 00:14:57,480
Then how do you know for sure that you and Shido are actually related to each other?

262
00:14:57,480 --> 00:15:01,520
Is that me?

263
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:03,860
A lot of little boys look alike.

264
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:06,120
No, this is definitely Shido.

265
00:15:06,980 --> 00:15:09,100
Like I said, my memory's pretty fuzzy.

266
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:12,400
But I do remember my older brother going off somewhere.

267
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,400
I was so devastated.

268
00:15:14,700 --> 00:15:17,340
But more than that, I spent every day worrying about him.

269
00:15:17,700 --> 00:15:18,940
That's why I'm so happy.

270
00:15:19,580 --> 00:15:21,400
And now you're sitting right in front of me.

271
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:22,480
I can't explain.

272
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:23,680
I'm ecstatic.

273
00:15:24,980 --> 00:15:25,340
Mana!

274
00:15:25,340 --> 00:15:27,300
I love you, brother!

275
00:15:28,420 --> 00:15:29,680
Get away from you!

276
00:15:30,220 --> 00:15:32,740
What do you think you're doing?

277
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:34,140
What the hell was that for?

278
00:15:34,300 --> 00:15:35,740
Shido is my family.

279
00:15:36,380 --> 00:15:39,260
I'm not going to let you or anyone else take him away from me.

280
00:15:39,340 --> 00:15:41,240
I wasn't planning on doing that.

281
00:15:41,580 --> 00:15:42,180
You weren't?

282
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:45,420
I just haven't gotten to see him in such a long time.

283
00:15:45,580 --> 00:15:46,940
I'm relieved he's doing well.

284
00:15:46,940 --> 00:15:50,860
And even now, he's still got a cute little sister looking after him.

285
00:15:51,100 --> 00:15:52,300
Oh, thank you.

286
00:15:52,560 --> 00:15:54,760
You should have opened your mouth before I kicked him.

287
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:58,440
Besides, at the end of the day, there's no beating the real sister.

288
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:00,120
Funny.

289
00:16:00,660 --> 00:16:01,840
You are joking, right?

290
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:02,280
Nope.

291
00:16:02,500 --> 00:16:03,820
I'm only stating facts.

292
00:16:04,020 --> 00:16:06,200
There's no bond stronger than blood that I know of.

293
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:09,580
I think you mean better as a neighbor who is near than a sister far away.

294
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:10,560
Hmm?

295
00:16:11,100 --> 00:16:11,680
No, no.

296
00:16:12,140 --> 00:16:14,320
An adopted sister's practically a stranger.

297
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:18,100
A real sister will always be closer because she shares the same blood.

298
00:16:18,580 --> 00:16:21,040
What's the point of emphasizing the blood part?

299
00:16:21,580 --> 00:16:22,100
Adopted?

300
00:16:22,280 --> 00:16:22,820
Or real?

301
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:24,400
What does all of this mean?

302
00:16:24,500 --> 00:16:25,600
Do you have any idea?

303
00:16:25,860 --> 00:16:26,840
Wake up, you two!

304
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:30,400
Everyone knows a sister can drive a man wild like Forbidden Fruit.

305
00:16:30,580 --> 00:16:32,540
Sweet, but just the right amount of tangy.

306
00:16:32,620 --> 00:16:32,940
Really?

307
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:35,040
Then sisters drive me wild, too.

308
00:16:35,220 --> 00:16:36,660
I want some Forbidden Fruit.

309
00:16:36,900 --> 00:16:38,680
Quit putting ideas in Atoka's head.

310
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:40,260
Just how much is your blood worth?

311
00:16:40,620 --> 00:16:43,060
Big whoop, it's not like a real sister could marry him.

312
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:47,520
Um, never mind.

313
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:49,480
Point is, his only sister is me.

314
00:16:49,560 --> 00:16:51,000
I don't think you make a very good one.

315
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:52,980
You're not as strong as his real little sister.

316
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:55,660
That has nothing to do with being a sister, you jerk face.

317
00:16:55,660 --> 00:16:57,660
Hey, girls, let's try to stay calm.

318
00:16:57,860 --> 00:16:59,500
Shito, which do you like more?

319
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:02,560
An actual blood sister or a stupid adopted sister?

320
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:03,860
Whoa, I'll pass.

321
00:17:04,020 --> 00:17:06,280
Yeah, I mean, talk about awkward, right?

322
