then I ought to at least meet them and tell them thanks.

325
00:17:13,700 --> 00:17:14,960
That's not a good idea.

326
00:17:15,340 --> 00:17:15,860
How come?

327
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:17,880
Is there something wrong with where you're living or what?

328
